  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Since I always noticed the feet being a bit glitchy when I do certain movements etc. with my Full Body Tracking on, I found out what Full Body Tracking with 7 Trackers (Both Arms, Both Upper Legs, Both Lower Legs, Hip) looks like also the controllers and the headset of course. And now I am asking myself why VRChat doesn't have support for more than 3 Trackers, I would love to have better movement when dancing etc. and I think it wouldn't be that hard to implement. \n\nAs more and more people get Full Body, I think the system should get an upgrade.\n\nThanks.",
